<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">master's component case</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

A <ansi fg="itemname">master's component case</ansi> of boiled leather and bone,
lined with silk and divided into dozens of labeled slots.
The ultimate crafting material storage for serious artisans.

