  <ansi fg="yellow">Capacity:</ansi>          35 items
  <ansi fg="yellow">Weight Reduction:</ansi>  45% of stored component weight
  <ansi fg="yellow">Slot:</ansi>              Components

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       tailoring (minimum 30)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     loom
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> leather strip (x3), cloth strip (x2),
               thread spool (x2), bone needle (x2)

